• Maintaining relevant knowledge
• Supporting continuity
• Applying retention policies
Privacy Layer
Responsible for:
• Disclosure boundaries
• Access control
• Data minimization
• Provider isolation
• Historical identity protection
Retrieval Layer
Responsible for:
• Context retrieval
• Memory retrieval
• Semantic retrieval
• Filtering protected historical identity
Interaction Layer
Responsible for:
• Presenting the current identity
• Natural interaction
